{"articleNo":"575673","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=575673&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[장학] (재)경주시장학회 2026년 장학생 선발 공고","writer":"학생과","writeDate":"2026.08.31","hit":"7829","attachments":[{"name":"(재)경주시장학회 장학생(대학생)선발 계획 공고.pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=575673&attachNo=167664"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><u><b><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><br></span></b></u></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><u><b><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">(재)경주시장학회 2026년 장학생 선발 공고</span></b></u></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><u><b><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><br></span></b></u></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">. </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">선발 인원 및 신청자격</span></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;  가. 선발인원 - 총 450명(일반전형: 432명, 특기생전형: 18명)&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; * 특기생전형 - 첨부파일 중, 붙임</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;1. 특기장학생(대학생) 선발계획 참조</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\"> </span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">나. </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">장학금액 - 1인당 200만원</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\"> </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">다. 신청자격(일반전형) (1세대 1인 신청)</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; - 공고일 현재 1년 이상 경주시 관내 거주자(부모 또는 학생)&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; - 현재 대학 재학생으로 직전학기 성적 평점 3.0점 이상인 자</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; - 총장, 학장 또는 학과장이 추천한 자</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><br></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">2. 제외대상&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\"> </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">가. 정규 학제 기간을 초과하여 재학 중인 자</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">나. 공고일 현재 휴학 중 또는 예정이거나, 정학, 퇴학 등 징계처분 받은 자</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; (추후 확인될 경우 장학생으로 선발되더라도 지급정지)</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\"><br></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">3. 접수기간: </span><b><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">2026. 9. 7.(월) 09:00 ~ 9. 23.(수) 18:00</span></b></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; *</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">주말 및 공휴일은 접수를 받지 않습니다.&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\"><br></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">4. 접수처:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">38089 경주시 황성공원로 29 실내체육관 남문 지하 (재)경주시장학회</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;(체육특기생) 경주시 황성공원로 30 경주시체육회</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\"><br></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">5. 신청방법: 장학생으로 신청하고자 하는 학생은 소정 서식의 신청서에 기타 구비서류를 첨부하여 제출(방문 또는 우편접수)</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; *</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">모든 서류는 원본제출을 원칙으로 함. 팩스, 사본, 스캔본은 접수불가</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; *</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">우편접수는 9. 23일자 우편소인분까지 가능함. 제출된 서류는 반환하지 않으며 접수된 후 구비서류 미비 시는 보완절차 없이 탈락함.&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\"><br></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">6. 장학금 지원신청서 : </span><b style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\"><u><a href=\"http://www.gjjhh.or.kr/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"tx-link\">www.gjjhh.or.kr</a></u></span></b><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\"> (정보자료실-서식자료실)에서 다운받아 사용.&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\"><br></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">이하 장학생 선발 관련 상세내용은 첨부파일의 선발계획 공고문&nbsp;내용을</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;확인 바랍니다.&nbsp;</span></b></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\"><br></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\"><br></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">첨부파일(붙임)&nbsp; (재)경주시장학회 장학생(대학생) 선발 계획 공고문 1부.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\"><br></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\"><br></span></p><div><br></div><div><br></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
